Date: Wed, 4 Mar 2026 17:46:07 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] patch-18: Chat Media URL Pipeline

End-to-end media URL propagation for chat history and live broadcasts:
- Extract audioUrl/imageUrl from toolResult details before sanitize
  strips them (audioUrlByIndex + imageUrlByIndex maps)
- Stamp extracted URLs onto final assistant messages in history response
- Collect MEDIA markers and mediaUrl/mediaUrls from deliver callbacks
- Attach audioUrl/imageUrl to broadcastChatFinal for live playback
- Add audioUrl to TTS tool result details
- Extract MEDIA markers in dispatch-from-config silent-reply filter
---
